WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:02.190
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:06.740
Today, I’m going to explain an American
science fiction thriller film called “The Signal"

00:00:07.445 --> 00:00:08.645
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:08.645 --> 00:00:10.532
Watch out and take care!

00:00:13.209 --> 00:00:18.210
The movie starts as we see a man named Nic,
who suffers from some kind of muscular dystrophy.

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:24.189
Nic is with his girlfriend, Haley, and their
best friend, Jonah, in a car, driving to California.

00:00:24.189 --> 00:00:28.720
The boys are dropping off Haley, who is moving
to California for further studies.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:31.860
The three were all classmates at MIT before
this.

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:34.579
A montage of the trio travelling follows.

00:00:34.579 --> 00:00:39.309
They eat at diners, visit aquariums, we also
see Nic jogging to a river that has swiped

00:00:39.309 --> 00:00:40.660
away a path.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:43.410
The trio is staying in a hotel room for the
night.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:47.989
Nic cannot seem to fall asleep when he suddenly
gets a text from a man named Nomad.

00:00:47.989 --> 00:00:52.480
Nomad is an anonymous hacker who has been
texting Nic and Jonah for a long time.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:57.130
He once hacked into MIT’s server as Nic
and Jonah, and almost got them expelled.

00:00:57.130 --> 00:00:59.660
He has been troubling them ever since.

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:04.230
When Nic threatens to expose him for hacking
into MIT, Nomad sends him a live video of

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:07.020
themselves in the exact position they are
in.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:11.180
He had hacked Haley’s laptop in the background
and is watching them through its webcam.

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:15.830
Nic then takes it upon himself to find Nomad’s
location, and eventually finds out that Nomad

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:18.070
is texting them from Nevada.

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:20.730
They continue the journey from the following
day.

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:24.200
On their way, Jonah receives a picture of
their car from Nomad.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:26.620
The three are tense about the situation.

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:30.720
Jonah in the backseat actively tries to find
Nomad’s exact location.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.090
They stop at a gas station and Nic gets out
to get them coffee.

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:38.322
Haley takes this opportunity, to ask Jonah
if Nic has said anything about her moving to him.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:43.280
She knows that her decision to move to California
has bothered Nic, but is worried because he

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:45.290
hasn’t said anything about it yet.

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:49.620
Nic falls and drops the coffee on himself,
while the other two run to help him.

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:53.460
He is embarrassed about his disability, and
it is evident when he walks away to get more

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:55.400
coffee, visibly sad.

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:59.770
The boys have found Nomad’s location and
figured that he is only 180 miles away from them.

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:04.650
They have decided to pay him a visit on their
way, but when they look around, they see that

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:06.280
Haley is missing.

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:08.690
Nic finds her sitting on a cliff nearby.

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:11.220
The two finally talk about their relationship.

00:02:11.220 --> 00:02:15.495
Nic doesn’t want his disability to hold
her back, so he wants to break up before she leaves.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.879
Haley tries to convince him that it will work
out.

00:02:18.879 --> 00:02:22.439
When he doesn’t listen, she takes off the
necklace he had given her as a gift and throws

00:02:22.439 --> 00:02:23.569
it away.

00:02:23.569 --> 00:02:26.450
The trio then makes their way to Nomad’s
location.

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:30.499
They stop at an abandoned house at night,
but they are skeptical about Nomad’s presence

00:02:30.499 --> 00:02:33.749
at such a place, but the boys go in to check
anyway.

00:02:33.749 --> 00:02:37.610
They look around with their flashlight, but
do not find anything.

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:40.599
Suddenly they hear Haley scream outside and
run to her.

00:02:40.599 --> 00:02:44.590
When they get to the car, she is missing and
the car’s radio is glitching.

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:47.189
The guys start to panic and scream her name.

00:02:47.189 --> 00:02:51.430
Just then, Nic flashes his light in a direction,
and sees Haley being pulled to the sky by

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:52.650
a weird force.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:57.900
Frightened, they run towards her, calling
her name, the screen abruptly goes blank.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:02.450
When Nic wakes up, he is in a hospital-like
facility, wearing only a hospital gown, and

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:03.709
is still hazy.

00:03:03.709 --> 00:03:08.030
A man in a white space suit-like attire brings
him to a room in a wheelchair.

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:12.170
Another man in the same attire introduces
himself as Dr. Wallace Damon.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:16.364
He starts to record their conversation and
asks him about the first time he encountered this signal.

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:19.860
Nic has no idea what he is talking about.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:24.370
He asks Damon about his friends and why he
is here; Damon replies that Nic and his friends

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:28.720
have come in contact with an EBE, an extraterrestrial
biological entity.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:32.499
Nic is still clueless as to what he is talking
about, and demands to meet his friends or

00:03:32.499 --> 00:03:33.810
call his family.

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:38.310
Damon stops Nic from talking, when he sees
Nic’s nose starting to bleed heavily.

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:41.389
He is then taken back to the room he was kept
in before.

00:03:41.389 --> 00:03:45.860
The following day, the facility workers take
him to the same room again; on his way, he

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:49.019
sees the workers cleaning a strange liquid
on the facility’s floor.

00:03:49.019 --> 00:03:51.749
Then he sees Haley lying in a room.

00:03:51.749 --> 00:03:55.109
He demands the workers take him to her, but
they do not agree.

00:03:55.109 --> 00:03:58.930
He is taken to Damon who says that he cannot
meet Haley at the moment and starts asking

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:03.260
him a series of strange questions like if
he has ten toes, and if he is from the earth.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:07.120
Damon then asks him about “the signals”,
referring to Nomad’s texts.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:10.569
Finally, he shows him a clip from the night
they were at Nomad’s.

00:04:10.569 --> 00:04:14.950
He zooms into an alien figure in the background,
which Nic is surprised to see.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:19.170
To his horror, Damon reveals that Nomad was
not just some hacker.

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:23.210
Sometime later, Nic is back in his room when
he hears someone whisper to him.

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:26.800
He looks around the room and figures the noise
is coming from a vent.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:30.070
It is Jonah hiding from the workers, to come
to talk to Nic.

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:33.590
He acknowledges that something is severely
wrong with the people there and fears they

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:36.040
might be performing experiments on them.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.040
The conversation ends abruptly.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:42.170
The following day, Nic is with Damon again,
who this time is performing a shape and color

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:43.460
test on him.

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:47.490
Agitated, Nic solves the test in one go and
demands to see Haley.

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:51.210
Damon agrees and takes him to the room where
Haley lies unconscious.

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:55.460
He claims that she is in a coma and promises,
the second she gains her consciousness, he

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:57.270
will be able to speak to her.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:05:01.370
From the next day, Nic starts devising a plan
to escape the facility.

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:05.440
He crushes the cracker given to him as food,
and places it onto the keypad to figure out

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:08.400
the password combination of the entrance door.

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:11.830
When he is back in his room, he puts his plan
into action.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:14.540
He goes to take Haley and ties her bed to
his wheelchair.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:19.140
Meanwhile, Damon goes to his room and finds
drawings of the facility all over his bed.

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:21.010
They get to know about his plan.

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:25.622
Nic somehow manages to get himself and Haley
to the exit door, but he cannot reach the keypad.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:30.190
Nic tries his best and even uses the hospital
tube to press in the keys.

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:33.520
However, Damon catches him before he can.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:36.620
He wakes up next to Haley, who is still unconscious.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:39.670
While trying to free from the guards, he falls
off the bed.

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:41.540
The men leave when they see him bleeding.

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:45.980
Then, Nic is horrified to see his legs have
been amputated, and replaced by prostheses

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:47.710
made from alien technology.

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:52.808
Damon, who has been watching him through a
one-way mirror, tells him that it is difficult to explain.

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:58.040
He then sends two workers to get Nic, but
his new legs have superhuman strength.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:00.260
Using them, Nic sends the door flying.

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:04.130
He drags Haley out with him, as it seems that
he can finally walk now.

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:07.965
As he walks through the hallway with her,
Damon follows them and catches them at the elevator.

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:12.850
He calmly explains to Nic that he will only
be able to help him inside the facility, and

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.050
if he goes out, he is on his own.

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:17.610
Nic ignores him and runs away with Haley.

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:21.620
He ends up in a dimly lit hallway and then
in a sewer-like system.

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:26.050
When he finally sees sunlight, he finds himself
in a desert in the middle of nowhere.

00:06:26.050 --> 00:06:29.350
Haley finally wakes up, and the two start
to walk away.

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:34.220
After a while, they are delighted to see a
car coming towards them and ask for a ride.

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:37.560
The driver is an old delirious woman named
Mirabelle.

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:41.340
Throughout the journey, she acts strange,
talking to “tiny angels” that she claims

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:42.940
are sent by god.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:45.080
She drops them off at a gas station.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:48.250
Nic goes in and tries to use a phone but it
doesn’t work.

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:53.053
He sees his face on the news on the TV, but
just then, Nic sees a red truck take Haley away.

00:06:53.674 --> 00:06:57.000
Using his new legs, Nic runs as fast as the
truck.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:00.780
Haley points a gun she found in the car at
the man trying to kidnap her.

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:03.380
The two throw the man out and drive his truck
away.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:07.990
Meanwhile, Damon sets a roadblock to look
for the two, and finds Mirabelle.

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:10.290
He asks her to come with him and she agrees.

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:13.820
Damon also carries a mysterious red briefcase
in his hands.

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:18.700
He interrogates her at the facility but strangely,
Mirabelle’s nose starts to bleed like Nic’s did earlier.

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:23.310
Damon brings out a gun from the briefcase
and the screen goes black, implying that he

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:24.900
shot her dead.

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:29.830
Nic and Haley, on the other hand, reach a
dead end and have no clue where they are.

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:33.120
When they drive back, they find an abandoned
visitor centre.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:35.450
They decide to stay there for the time being.

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:39.150
Inside, Nic tries to use a phone but it doesn’t
work either.

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:43.740
Haley then finds a map of the place, however,
Nic cannot decipher where they are.

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:48.310
Damon and his men continue with their pursuit,
and find Haley’s abductor in his home.

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:52.870
He seems to have gone insane, and talks about
his family sitting beside him when he is alone.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:56.380
He points a gun at Damon but it doesn’t
work when he tries to shoot him.

00:07:56.380 --> 00:08:00.550
Damon then shoots the man dead, covers him
with a blanket, and leaves.

00:08:00.550 --> 00:08:04.130
Meanwhile, Nic and Haley hear a noise from
downstairs and hide.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:08.330
They come across a worker from the facility,
but it turns out that it is Jonah.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:12.750
The friends finally reunite and share their
experiences, it turns out he also escaped

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:13.750
from the facility.

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:18.350
At night, Nic notices a mark on Haley’s
back and believes that she has been experimented

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:19.580
upon too.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:23.920
Later Jonah tells him that they might be in
area 51, and we get to see that his arms have

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:26.390
been changed into prostheses.

00:08:26.390 --> 00:08:30.870
The following day, they drive in search of
an exit, but are caught in a roadblock.

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:34.849
Jonah attacks a guard and fires some rounds
using his gun, while Nic and Haley crouch

00:08:34.849 --> 00:08:36.219
down by the truck.

00:08:36.219 --> 00:08:38.740
Soon, Jonah is severely wounded.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:42.079
He tells Nic to take Haley and go while he
distracts the guards.

00:08:42.079 --> 00:08:45.380
Nic doesn’t want to leave his best friend
but has no other way.

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:49.529
Jonah uses his new arms to destroy a cylinder
blocking the truck, and the other two run away.

00:08:50.529 --> 00:08:54.160
He then punches the ground creating a shock
wave that shakes the guards.

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:58.822
He dies in the encounter, but it all goes
in vain as Nic and Haley are soon caught by Damon.

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:02.589
Their truck hits a spike line on the road
and flips over.

00:09:02.589 --> 00:09:05.139
The two come out of it, but are severely injured.

00:09:05.139 --> 00:09:08.490
Haley hands Nic the necklace that he thought
she had thrown away.

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:10.769
The guards take Haley away in a chopper.

00:09:10.769 --> 00:09:15.926
After she is gone, Nic notices Damon’s name
tag, and figures that his name backwards is Nomad.

00:09:16.649 --> 00:09:20.290
Damon comes clean, and says that he has been
Nomad the whole time.

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:24.790
He had brought Nic to them, posing as Nomad
to test alien technology on him.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:29.234
He then claims that his legs are examples
of a perfect combination of human and alien technology.

00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:34.279
Realizing that they were used as mere experiments,
Nic is agitated.

00:09:34.279 --> 00:09:37.470
His legs start to glow red, and he runs at
supersonic speed.

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:42.929
After a while, he crashes into an invisible
barrier that leads him to a larger exterior facility.

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:47.390
Damon approaches the hole he has created in
the environment, and takes off his suit to

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:49.290
reveal a robotic head.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:53.670
As it turns out, he and everyone else in the
facility are a robotic alien species.

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:58.589
Mirabelle and the kidnaper were abducted humans,
who were driven insane because their brains

00:09:58.589 --> 00:10:00.970
couldn’t sync with the alien technology.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:04.160
Since they could not adapt to it, Damon had
to kill them.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:07.649
When Nic turns around, he sees that he is
on a whole new planet.

00:10:07.649 --> 00:10:11.759
The desert was just a simulation to trick
them into thinking they were still on earth.

00:10:11.759 --> 00:10:15.930
The camera finally zooms out, and we see that
the planet is highly modernized with several

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:19.420
skyscrapers and has a parabolic sun shield
on the top.

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:23.339
Nic is the only human there, his best friend
is dead and his girlfriend has been taken

00:10:23.339 --> 00:10:24.360
away from him.

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:28.006
Subscribe for more videos like this, turn
on notifications, and leave a like to help

00:10:28.006 --> 00:10:29.006
the channel out.

00:10:29.653 --> 00:10:30.504
Thank you for watching.

